      "title": "Our Revolution Endorses Chris Van Hollen for Senate Majority Leader",
      "description": "Our Revolution, the nation\u2019s largest grassroots progressive organization endorsed Sen. Chris Van Hollen for Senate majority leader and urged Senate Democrats to vote for him over Sen. Chuck Schumer. The endorsement builds on the organization\u2019s ongoing grassroots campaign to replace Schumer and secure an open, competitive leadership election. \u201cWorking people organized to win this majority, and they expect it to fight for them,\u201d said Joseph Geevarghese, Executive Director of Our Revolution. \u201cTo be a real opposition party, Democrats have to take on corporate power, including the big donors and party insiders who stand in the way of change. That means getting corporate money out of politics, ending U.S. military aid to Israel, and fighting to pass Medicare for All. That\u2019s the working-class agenda we\u2019ve been organizing for, and it\u2019s why we\u2019ve called on Chuck Schumer to step aside. Chris Van Hollen has stepped up to challenge the status quo, and we\u2019re urging Senate Democrats to vote for him.\u201d In Our Revolution\u2019s November 6\u20137 survey of 4,308 progressive respondents, 72% wanted new Senate leadership, 22% said it depended on whether Schumer delivers, and 5% supported his continued leadership. The results reflect participating respondents and are not representative of all Democratic voters. Our Revolution is asking supporters to sign the petition calling on Senate Democrats to replace Schumer.",
